      "notes": "Suggested Use Consume one or more capsules daily or as recommended by your physician. As with any dietary supplement, this product is most effective as part of a healthy diet and active lifestyle. For questions about the use of this product call 800.332.7799."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "For over 40 years\r\nUnsurpassed. \r\nPurity. Quality. Integrity. Effectiveness. \r\nAndrew Lessman \r\nFounder of ProCaps Labs\r\nHSN\r\nwww.HSN.com \r\n800.944.9999 \r\nwww.QVC.com\r\n800.345.1515\r\nQuestions? Call 800.800.1200\r\nwww.ProCapsLabs.com"
